  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 102.22 Authorized waste",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 102.22 “Authorized waste” means a waste that is approved by the department for receipt by a facility, as specified in the permit or permit exemption as applicable.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 102.17) (see Revision Note #2 at cha+\n\npter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
